{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chicken Chasers is a silly action game where you chase chickens around different environments, each with unique challenges, while maneuvering the novel controls of a pogo stick. Your only objective is to <strong>collect all the coins in the levels</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The unorthodox controls and chaotic chicken movement patterns create an enraging and engaging player experience. Chicken Chasers is designed to be a causal experience -- you can finish the levels at your own pace. There is also a Steam-integrated leader board to celebrate the fastest level completion times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hone your skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518050/extras/hone_your_skills_v2.gif?t=1745334960\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore new levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518050/extras/explore_new_levels_v2.gif?t=1745334960\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overcome challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518050/extras/challenges_v2.gif?t=1745334960\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embrace the chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518050/extras/embrace_chaos_v2.gif?t=1745334960\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518050?t=1745334960","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518050?t=1745334960","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518050/8a09d14d64a19791bf230ac8c89595df7871cc12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745334960","capsule_imagev5":"https: